# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal and career material — NEVER in this repository
#
# This repository is intended to become public. Anything matching the patterns
# below would be permanent in git history from the moment it is committed, and
# deleting it in a later commit does not remove it.
#
# Note what .gitignore CANNOT do, because it is the reason tools/check_repo_
# hygiene.py exists:
#   - It is client-side only. A file uploaded through the GitHub web UI never
#     consults it. That is exactly how a job-search log reached this repo.
#   - It has no effect on a file that is already tracked.
#   - `git add -f` overrides it silently.
# It reduces accidents. The CI gate is the control.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Job search
*SEARCH-LOG*
*search-log*
DAILY-SEARCH*
JOB-SEARCH*
*APPLICATION-NOTES*
*SEARCH-PLAYBOOK*
*SELECTION-AND-TAILORING*
applications/
cover-letter*/
*cover-letter*
*COVER-LETTER*
*-outreach*
recruiter*/

